  <p>
    If you want to quickly edit an image, trim an audio file or convert a document online, you want one thing above all: to get started right away. Nobody wants to sit through endless loading times, struggle with sign-up forms or click away ad banners.
  </p>

  <p>
    That is why kodinitools.com is built from the ground up so that its tools are ready to use directly in your browser – no detours, no data stored on third-party servers and, above all, lightning fast.
  </p>

  <p>
    A recent test with Google PageSpeed Insights shows what this means for your everyday work in front of the screen.
  </p>

  <h2>Ready Instantly: 97 out of 100 Points on Desktop</h2>

  <p>
    When you open kodinitools.com on your laptop or PC, there is practically no noticeable delay:
  </p>

