  <h2>Strong on the Go, Too: Smooth Performance on Your Smartphone</h2>

  <p>
    On mobile devices, connections on the go are often unreliable and smartphones have less computing power than a desktop computer. Even so, the mobile version achieves a solid 89 points in Google's test:
  </p>

  <figure class="blog-demo">
    <img
      src="/image/speed-mobile-blog-en.webp"
