  <ul>
    <li><strong>Inputs respond instantly:</strong> Script blocking time is a negligible 30 milliseconds (Total Blocking Time). When you tap a button, the interface reacts immediately and does not freeze.</li>
    <li><strong>Stable layout, no mis-taps:</strong> Many mobile pages jump around while loading, so you accidentally tap the wrong thing. With a layout stability score of almost zero (0.015 CLS), every element on our pages stays exactly where it belongs.</li>
    <li><strong>100 % technical standard:</strong> A full 100 points for SEO and 96 points for best practices ensure secure, modern and reliable access in your mobile browser.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What We Are Improving for You Next</h2>

  <p>
    Despite the strong mobile result, we want to get the most out of it on the go as well: we are currently optimising how the first graphical elements load on smartphones to push the current load time of 3.6 seconds even further down. The goal is for the mobile tools to feel just as weightless and immediate as they do on desktop.
  </p>

